BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pisgah Monster-Cross Challenge
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260912
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260912
DTSTAMP:20260904T133534Z
UID:005472d939111204@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:festival
DESCRIPTION:The Pisgah Monster-Cross Challenge is the premiere all-road ra
 cing event in the region. Participants are challenged to complete a 69.2 m
 ile course with 8\,777’of climbing along scenic gravel and paved roads. 
 The riders will be treated to some of the finest gravel roads in the Pisga
 h and Nantahala National Forests\, which is a one-of-a-kind opportunity in
  the racing world. Monster-Cross is a dream gravel endurance event where k
 een race tactics and strategy\, along with overall fitness\, proper gear s
 election\, and sheer luck are key to success. There will be three Rest Are
 as along the way that will be stocked with water\, food (PB&J\, fruit\, sa
 lty snacks\, sweet snacks\, bars)\, first aid\, and neutral mechanical sup
 port. Racers will be covering a lot of ground on the map\, riding through 
 some of the m\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-monster-cross-challen
 ge-2026\n\nSource: BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calend
 ar
GEO:35.2830246;-82.7218935
LOCATION:1284 Pisgah Hwy\, Pisgah Forest\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/pisgah-monster-cross-challenge-2026
END:VEVENT
