BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pisgah 111 / 555
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTSTAMP:20260904T133534Z
UID:c6d05d9f51734aa6@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:race
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to turn the volume up to 111! The Pisgah 111 is th
 e quintessential crusher of a cross-country endurance MTB race. Racers fol
 low a 65.1 mile course with 10\,200' feet of climbing along the most iconi
 c trails and gravel roads known in Pisgah National Forest. Just peek at th
 e course map and list of trails and you’ll immediately get chills just t
 hinking about the epic scenery and terrain you’ll encounter. This is a t
 rue mountain bike race with no map reading skills required\, just follow t
 he arrows. Think of it as the most exciting (and grueling) tour of Pisgah 
 you can imagine during the peak of the leaves changing in the forest. It c
 ertainly wouldn’t hurt to study the map and cue sheets to know what you
 ’re getting yourself into\, as some of these trails will test your lungs
  and your le\n\nMore: http://www.BikeReg.com/2026-pisgah-111-555\n\nSource
 : BikeReg\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
GEO:35.2830246;-82.7218935
LOCATION:1284 Pisgah Hwy\, Pisgah Forest\, NC
URL:http://www.BikeReg.com/2026-pisgah-111-555
END:VEVENT
