DESCRIPTION:Riders have two course options: The HARDford 50 and the HARDER
 ford 75. Both fully-supported courses are 50+ miles and 6\,500 ft. of clim
 bing\, and 75 miles and 10\,300 ft. of climbing (respectively) through Che
 rokee and Pisgah National Forests. CX and MTB are both appropriate. The ro
 utes are 70% gravel\, 10% dirt\, and the remainder on pavement. There will
  be two fully stocked aid stops along the H50 course\, and three along the
  H75. Start/Finish: Rapid Expeditions\, 3605 Hartford Rd\, Hartford\, TN 3
 7753 When: Sunday\, August 1\, 2027 at 8am (7:45am rider meeting at the st
 arting line) Maps: Riders are responsible for downloading and using the pr
 ovided maps. Course will not be marked. Click here for link to course map.
